OL,3,GNEWSAPair bailed following Newry
OL,4,Aattempted murder arrests
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman who were arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder following
OL,8,Fa stabbing in Newry, County Down, on
OL,9,FSunday have been released on bail.
OL,11,FPolice were called to a house in the
OL,12,FWoodhill area after 06:00 BST.
OL,14,FInside they found a man with stab
OL,15,Fwounds.
OL,17,FPolice said the pair have been bailed
OL,18,Fto allow for further enquiries.
